      "text": "[6:20PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nInward and outward Ikate Gate from Dome on Freedom Way is good through Carwash and Itedo.\n\nConnecting Zenith by Dome is good, Zenith to UBA traffic light intersection down to Lekki Ikoyi link bridge roundabout is also good.\n\nLekki ikoyi link bridge roundabout to Alenxander Avenue is good for now, while the return journey is slow due to speed breaker before descending towards Lekki Ikoyi link bridge roundabout on Admiralty Way.\n\nInw Lekki Peninsula Scheme 1 Gate from Lekki Ikoyi link bridge roundabout is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
