      "text": "[6:49PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from UBA Roundabout to NITEL intersection, State House to McWen Bridge, and Zone 2 underpass to Flagstaff House.\nOnikan Roundabout to NITEL intersection is also moving well, along with Broad Street from General Hospital to Tinubu Square.\n \nAdditionally, Odunlami Street to Campos Square and Igbosere Road, including Catholic Mission Street, are clear. \n\nHowever, approaching Davies Street, there's slow movement due to commercial activities, but traffic personnel are on the ground to manage the situation. \nOverall, traffic is moving, with no major issues reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
